 durch ZOLLER TMS Tool Management Solutions</p> <span class=\"sub sub_savings\"></span> </div> <div class=\"col-xs-4 col-sm-4 col-md-3\"> <div class=\"field\"> <span class=\"currency\"></span><span class=\"calc_result5\"></span> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"result total\"> <div class=\"row\"> <div class=\"col-xs-8 col-sm-8 col-md-9\"> <h3 class=\"h3\">Gesamteinsparung mit ZOLLER</h3> </div> <div class=\"col-xs-4 col-sm-4 col-md-3\"> <div class=\"field\"> <b><span class=\"currency large\"></span><span class=\"large calc_result_total\"></span></b> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"result\"> <div class=\"row\"> <div class=\"col-xs-8 col-sm-8 col-md-9\"> <p>Amortisationszeitraum für das Einstell-und Messgerät</p> <span class=\"sub sub_roi\"></span> </div> <div class=\"col-xs-4 col-sm-4 col-md-3\"> <div class=\"field\"> <span class=\"calc_result4\"></span> Jahre </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div>",
